echnologies and extended product validation cycles; delays in customer approvals or slower-than-expected adoption may impact revenue realisation and delay revenue ramp-up despite ongoing development and customer interest.","risk":"Market transition and technology / validation-cycle risk in EV powertrain and power electronics"},{"note":"Dependence on critical components and materials, including electronic components and rare earth elements, may lead to supply disruptions or cost volatility that impacts production planning and cost structures.","risk":"Supply chain and raw material dependency, including rare earth elements"},{"note":"Manufacturing operations are subject to environmental laws and regulations relating to emissions, waste management, energy consumption and workplace safety; tightening standards or non-compliance may increase compliance costs, cause operational disruptions or reputational impact.","risk":"Environmental and regulatory compliance risk"},{"note":"Increasing competition from domestic and global players in both the fasteners and EV components businesses may exert pricing pressure and impact margins.","risk":"Competitive intensity in fasteners and EV components"},{"note":"Increasing reliance on digital systems and automation exposes the Company to potential cyber threats and data breaches.","risk":"Cyber security and data privacy risk"},{"note":"The availability and retention of skilled talent, particularly in specialised areas such as power electronics and advanced manufacturing, remains critical to business growth.","risk":"Human resource risk in specialised technology domains"}],"rpt":{},"rpt_date":"","s":"STERTOOLS","sector":"Automobile and Auto Components","sk":{"as_of":"2026-05-22","cagrs":[{"cagr":"7.0%","period":"CY2024-CY2030","segment":"Global wire harness market"},{"cagr":"13-15%","period":"FY2025-FY2031E","segment":"Domestic wiring harness market — overall"},{"cagr":"6-8%","period":"FY2025-FY2031E","segment":"Domestic wiring harness